  "subtitle": "Capture coverage source, member reference, service date, and network status; confirm benefit response and patient notice.",
  "description": "Insurance Verification records coverage source, member reference, service date, network status, benefit response, and patient notice. Insurance Verification evidence stays linked.",
  "use_case": "Use this insurance verification authorization decision when staff must document coverage source and member reference. Reconcile service date, network status, benefit response, and patient notice before the insurance verification handoff. Use the payer response, portal screenshot or call reference, representative name, benefit summary, network response, authorization indicator, patient estimate route, and notice receipt. This administrative record centers payer eligibility, plan dates, network response, benefit limitation, deductible or cost-share source, authorization indicator, representative reference, and patient notice. Ask the assigned insurance verification reviewer to confirm coverage source against the organization's policy.",
